    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/d765171bd0a198d770de9103e9d2cde6.avif?t=1733529892\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/2e397852fec4dd70bcdbc74461189c3d.avif?t=1733529892\" /></div><br><br><strong> Help Santa to pick up presents on the trail! The more gifts you collect, the higher your score! You can also buy new characters and sledge in the shop!<br>But Christmas Race 2 does not just talk about Christmas and Santa Claus, 5 new universes are unlockable by buying special characters! </strong><br><br><strong> Merry Christmas! </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/d27c37f01df4032c788044d3e3f9eda1.webp?t=1733529892\" /></div><br><br><strong> Features: </strong><br><br>\u25a0 A very slippery slope!<br>\u25a0 Pretty decorations!<br>\u25a0 A shop with no less than 20 characters and 36 sleds!<br>\u25a0 6 different worlds!<br>\u25a0 Infinite levels and completely random!<br>\u25a0 Nice ambient music!<br>\u25a0 Addictive gameplay!<br>\u25a0 Random gifts every hour!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/d27c37f01df4032c788044d3e3f9eda1.webp?t=1733529892\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/2e397852fec4dd70bcdbc74461189c3d.avif?t=1733529892\" /></div><br><br><strong> Help Santa to pick up presents on the trail! The more gifts you collect, the higher your score! You can also buy new characters and sledge in the shop!<br>But Christmas Race 2 does not just talk about Christmas and Santa Claus, 5 new universes are unlockable by buying special characters! </strong><br><br><strong> Merry Christmas! </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/d27c37f01df4032c788044d3e3f9eda1.webp?t=1733529892\" /></div><br><br><strong> Features: </strong><br><br>\u25a0 A very slippery slope!<br>\u25a0 Pretty decorations!<br>\u25a0 A shop with no less than 20 characters and 36 sleds!<br>\u25a0 6 different worlds!<br>\u25a0 Infinite levels and completely random!<br>\u25a0 Nice ambient music!<br>\u25a0 Addictive gameplay!<br>\u25a0 Random gifts every hour!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801890/extras/d27c37f01df4032c788044d3e3f9eda1.webp?t=1733529892\" /></div>",
